<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C119016/C2998>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "Includes dyspnea on exertion, dyspnea at rest, orthopnea, and paroxysmal nocturnal dyspnea." ;
