.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C119016/C78262>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "Increased tissue fluid indicated by perceptible pitting indentation on lower leg, foot or sacrum after palpation." ;
