    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of an atrial rhythm which originates from the sinoatrial node that is considered normal for the population." ;
