    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of pathologic Q waves, which is suggestive of myocardial infarction of one or more regions of the heart. No specification is provided for localization." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "MYOCARDIAL INFARCTION" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Myocardial Infarction" ;
