    ct:Codelist%20Code "C120522" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Name "Holter ECG Results" ;
    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Acute Anterolateral Myocardial Infarction by ECG Finding" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120522/C102592>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of pathologic Q waves with accompanying ST elevation in leads V1 through V4, which is suggestive of acute myocardial infarction of the anteroseptal wall of the left ventricle." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "ACUTE ANTEROSEPTAL WALL MYOCARDIAL INFARCTION" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Acute anteroseptal MI; Acute Anteroseptal Wall Myocardial Infarction" ;
    ct:Code "C102592" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Code "C120522" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Name "Holter ECG Results" ;
    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Acute Anteroseptal Myocardial Infarction by ECG Finding" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120522/C102593>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of pathologic Q waves with accompanying ST elevation in leads I and aVL, which is suggestive of acute myocardial infarction of the high lateral wall of the left ventricle." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "ACUTE HIGH LATERAL WALL MYOCARDIAL INFARCTION" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Acute High Lateral Wall Myocardial Infarction" ;
    ct:Code "C102593" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Code "C120522" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Name "Holter ECG Results" ;
    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Acute High Lateral Myocardial Infarction by ECG Finding" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120522/C102594>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding in leads V1 or V2 of an initial R wave duration greater than or equal to 40 ms, R wave greater than S wave, upright T wave, with accompanying ST elevation, which is suggestive of acute myocardial infarction of the ventricular wall of the left ventricle. Evidence of inferior or lateral myocardial infarction is usually also present. Additional criteria include ST elevation > 100 microvolts in the right precordial leads V4R through V6R." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "ACUTE RIGHT VENTRICULAR WALL MYOCARDIAL INFARCTION" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Acute Right ventricular MI; Acute Right Ventricular Wall Myocardial Infarction" ;
    ct:Code "C102594" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Code "C120522" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Name "Holter ECG Results" ;
    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Acute Right Ventricular Myocardial Infarction by ECG Finding" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120522/C102595>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of pathologic Q waves with accompanying ST elevation in leads V1, V2 and often V3, which is suggestive of acute myocardial infarction of the intraventricular septum." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "ACUTE SEPTAL WALL MYOCARDIAL INFARCTION" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Acute Septal Wall Myocardial Infarction" ;
    ct:Code "C102595" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Code "C120522" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Name "Holter ECG Results" ;
    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Acute Septal Myocardial Infarction by ECG Finding" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120522/C102596>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of a sinus beat followed by a premature atrial complex for three or more consecutive cycles; a regularly irregular rhythm of normal and abnormal P waves in a 1-1 ratio." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "ATRIAL BIGEMINY" ;
    ct:Code "C102596" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Code "C120522" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Name "Holter ECG Results" ;
    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Atrial Bigeminy by ECG Finding" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120522/C102597>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding in which two premature atrial complexes occur sequentially; there may be one or more occurrences during an electrocardiographic recording." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "ATRIAL COUPLETS" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Atrial Couplets" ;
    ct:Code "C102597" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Code "C120522" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Name "Holter ECG Results" ;
    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Atrial Couplet by ECG Finding" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120522/C102598>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of two sinus beats followed by a premature atrial complex for 3 or more consecutive cycles; a regularly irregular rhythm of normal and abnormal P waves in a 2-1 ratio." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "ATRIAL TRIGEMINY" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Atrial Trigeminy" ;
    ct:Code "C102598" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Code "C120522" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Name "Holter ECG Results" ;
    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Atrial Trigeminy by ECG Finding" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120522/C102603>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of a premature atrial complexes that are is not conducted to the ventricles, and that are is not followed by a QRS complex; there may be one or more occurrences during an electrocardiographic recording." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "PREMATURE ATRIAL COMPLEXES BLOCKED" ;
