    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Dextrocardia by ECG Finding" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120522/C102628>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding where the amplitude of the R wave becomes greater than the amplitude of the S wave in the QRS complex at an unusually early point in the precordial leads, usually in leads V1 or V2." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "EARLY R WAVE TRANSITION" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Early R Wave Progression; Early R Wave Transition" ;
