.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120522/C102690>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of pathologic Q waves in leads V5, V6, I and aVL, which is suggestive of myocardial infarction of the lateral wall of the left ventricle, without evidence of current or ongoing acute infarction." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "OLD OR AGE INDETERMINATE LATERAL WALL MYOCARDIAL INFARCTION" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Old Or Age Indeterminate Lateral Wall Myocardial Infarction" ;
