.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120522/C102706>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of ST depression and T wave inversion in the presence of increased QRS amplitude which are thought to be due to left ventricular hypertrophy." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "REPOLARIZATION ABNORMALITY SECONDARY TO VENTRICULAR HYPERTROPHY" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Repolarization Abnormality Secondary To Ventricular Hypertrophy; ST-T change due to ventricular hypertrophy" ;
