    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of three normal QRS complexes followed by a premature ventricular complex for three or more consecutive cycles; a regularly irregular rhythm of normal and abnormal QRS complexes in a 3-1 ratio." ;
