<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120525/C181395>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "A measurement of the functional binding microbial-induced antibody in a biological specimen. A functional microbial-induced antibody is defined as antibodies that have agonist or antagonist effects on pathogens or their toxins in the presence of other effector molecules or cells. For example, the effects of functional antibodies can include neutralization, phagocytosis, antibody-dependent cellular cytotoxicity, and complement-mediated lysis. The production of this antibody may be triggered by naturally occurring infection, vaccination and/or viral vector-based therapy using a whole microbe or component(s) of a microbe." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "MBFAB" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Functional Microbial-induced Antibody" ;
    ct:Code "C181395" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Code "C120525" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Name "Immunogenicity Specimen Assessments Test Code" ;
    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Functional Microbial-induced Antibody Measurement" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120525/C181396>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "A measurement of the neutralizing binding microbial-induced antibody in a biological specimen. A neutralizing microbial-induced antibody is a type of functional antibody that's defined as antibodies that bind to, block and prevent microbes from infecting cells. The production of this antibody may be triggered by naturally occurring infection, vaccination and/or viral vector-based therapy using a whole microbe or component(s) of a microbe." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "MBNAB" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Neutralizing Microbial-induced Antibody" ;
    ct:Code "C181396" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Code "C120525" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Name "Immunogenicity Specimen Assessments Test Code" ;
    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Neutralizing Microbial-induced Antibody Measurement" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C120525/C181397>
