    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An AUC calculation method that utilizes the linear trapezoidal interpolation rule for the entire concentration curve." ;
