    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An antigen of the diphosphatidylglycerol lipid found uniquely in the inner membrane of mitochondria. It can be considered as an autoantigen and is commonly associated with the autoimmune diseases antiphospholipid syndrome and systemic rheumatic diseases." ;
