    ct:CDISC%20Definition "The 220 kDa alpha isoform of the MI-2 antigen encoded by CHD3 gene, which is a helicase in the nucleosome remodeling-deacetylase complex involved in transcription regulation. It can be considered as an autoantigen and is commonly associated with the systemic autoimmune myopathy dermatomyositis." ;
