.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C181169/C201389>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "The approximately 67 kDa membrane fusion glycoprotein encoded by the vesicular stomatitis Indiana virus VSIVgp4 (G) gene that enables viral-host receptor recognition and binding." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "VESICULAR STOMATITIS INDIANA VIRUS GLYCOPROTEIN" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Vesicular Stomatitis Indiana Virus G Protein; VSIV G protein; VSV Indiana Glycoprotein" ;
