    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Vesicular Stomatitis Indiana Virus Glycoprotein" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C181169/C201390>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "A group of autoimmune substances found in the striated muscles that may be comprised of (but not limited to) the muscle proteins titin, myosin, actin, ryanodine receptor and potassium voltage-gated channel subunit Kv1.4. They are commonly associated with the autoimmune diseases rheumatic fever and myasthenia gravis." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "STRIATED MUSCLE AUTOANTIGENS" ;
    ct:Code "C201390" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Code "C181169" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Name "Binding Agent for Immunogenicity Tests" ;
    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Striated Muscle Autoantigens" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C181169/C201391>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "A group of autoimmune substances in the P450 mixed-function oxidase system that may be comprised of (but not limited to) cytochrome P450 2D6 (LKM type 1), P450 2C9 (LKM type 2) and P450 1A2 (LKM type 3). They are commonly associated with autoimmune hepatitis." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "LIVER KIDNEY MICROSOMAL ANTIGENS" ;
