    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "A group of autoimmune substances found in the neurons that may be comprised of (but not limited to) the Hu proteins HuD, HuC, HuR (HuA), and HuB (Hel-N1) and Hel-N2. They can be considered as neuronal autoantigens and are commonly associated with autoimmune neurodegenerative disorders related to cancer, such as paraneoplastic neurologic syndrome." ;
