.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C181169/C201395>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "A group of autoimmune substances found in the neurons that may be comprised of (but not limited to) the Ri proteins Nova-1 and Nova-2. They can be considered as neuronal autoantigens and are commonly associated with autoimmune neurodegenerative disorders related to cancer, such as paraneoplastic neurologic syndrome." ;
