    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "A group of autoimmune substances related to the Pemphigoid diseases that may be mainly comprised of (but not limited to) the basement membrane zone antigens and proteins from the collagen superfamily." ;
