    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An antigen encoded by the NT5C1A gene and is involved in the dephosphorylation of nucleotides to nucleosides. It can be considered as an autoantigen and is commonly associated with autoimmune disease sporadic inclusion body myositis." ;
