    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An antigen encoded by the THSD7A gene that functions as a membrane-associated glycoprotein and plays a role in the regulation of endothelial cell migration and actin cytoskeleton rearrangement. It can be considered as an autoantigen and is commonly associated with the autoimmune disease membranous nephropathy." ;
