    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An antigen encoded by the CNTNAP1 gene and is involved in the organization of myelinated axons and neuronal signaling. It can be considered as an autoantigen and is commonly associated with autoimmune neuropathies." ;
