    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An antigen encoded by the GRM5 gene and is involved in both glutamate binding and downstream signal transduction. It can be considered as an autoantigen and is commonly associated with autoimmune encephalitis." ;
