    ct:CDISC%20Definition "A study that begins as a Phase I study and transitions into Phases II and III based upon successful completion of each previous portion." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "PHASE I/II/III TRIAL" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "1/2/3; Trial Phase 1/2/3" ;
