    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "A type of study designed to identify actions necessary to permanently eliminate or reduce the long-term risk to human life as a result of a particular medication or treatment regimen." ;
