    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of pathologic Q waves with accompanying ST elevation in leads V1, V2 and often V3, which is suggestive of acute myocardial infarction of the intraventricular septum." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "ACUTE SEPTAL WALL MYOCARDIAL INFARCTION" ;
