    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of a QT interval corrected for heart rate that is shorter than the lower limit of normal." ;
