    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding in which there are variations in the shape, amplitude, or direction of the T wave from one beat to the next." ;
