    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of premature atrial complexes which have a single distinct morphology, suggesting origin at one atrial site." ;
