<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C71150/C114174>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic recording in which an interchange of one or more limb lead electrodes is suspected, and for which an interpretation is performed as though the leads have in fact been interchanged." ;
