    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of an escape beat following a pause which originates in the AV junction. This is manifest as a QRS complex of supraventricular origin not preceded by a P wave; there may be one or more occurrences during an electrocardiographic recording." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "JUNCTIONAL ESCAPE COMPLEXES" ;
    ct:CDISC%20Synonym%28s%29 "Junctional Escape Beat; Junctional Escape Complex" ;
