    ct:Codelist%20Name "ECG Result" ;
    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Undetermined Rhythm by ECG Finding" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C71150/C116132>
