    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Non-Diagnostic Q Waves by ECG Finding" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C71150/C116135>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of PR segment depression below the iso-electric line in multiple precordial and/or limb leads." ;
