    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An electrocardiographic finding of a supraventricular QRS complex followed by a premature supraventricular complex for 3 or more consecutive cycles; a regularly irregular rhythm of normal and abnormal QRS complexes in a 1-1 ratio." ;
