.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C74456/C186114>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "A muscle of the forearm, in general extending from the posterior surface of the distal third of the radius and the adjacent interosseous membrane to the posterior surface of the base of the proximal phalanx of the thumb; primary function is to extend the thumb at the carpometacarpal and metacarpophalangeal joints." ;
