    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Epithelial Cell" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C78734/C12589>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "The keratin-producing cell of the epidermis that forms in the deep basal layer of the stratified epithelium." ;
