    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "A titration method in which the titrating agent is generated electrochemically in solution and the magnitude and duration of the current are measured to determine the amount of the substance." ;
