    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An optical coherence tomography imaging method that utilizes motion contrast imaging to capture the patterns of moving red blood cell reflectance across time and create high-resolution, 3D angiograms of vascular networks." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "OPTICAL COHERENCE TOMOGRAPHY ANGIOGRAPHY" ;
