.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C85492/C198351>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "A cell-based assay that utilizes a luciferase complementation reporter mechanism to detect regulated protein-protein interactions in situ." ;
