    ct:NCI%20Preferred%20Term "Intra-Arterial Differential Pressure Transduction" ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/id/sdtm-ct/SDTM%20Terminology/C85492/C202397>
    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "Microscopy of specimens stained with a secondary fluorophore-conjugated binding agent to detect a primary, unconjugated antibody directed against a target antigen." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "INDIRECT IMMUNOFLUORESCENT MICROSCOPY" ;
