    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "A type of digital radiography in which X-rays are converted to visible light by a scintillator and then registered by a detector, without the need for an intermediate cassette." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "INDIRECT DIGITAL RADIOGRAPHY" ;
