    a <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/def/sdtm-ct#SDTM%20Terminology> ;
    ct:CDISC%20Definition "An augmented unipolar electrocardiogram limb lead in which the positive (red) electrode is situated on the left pelvic limb and the negative electrode is a combination of the right thoracic limb (white) electrode and the left thoracic limb (black) electrode. Measures the electrical activity of the electrode on the left pelvic limb." ;
    ct:CDISC%20Submission%20Value "LEAD aVF" ;
    ct:Code "C90360" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Code "C90013" ;
    ct:Codelist%20Name "ECG Lead" ;
